    "updated_at": "2020-06-24T01:09:49Z",
    "body": "Here's what I'm proposing (and I'm new to rust, so it might take a few days)\r\n\r\ndefault config:\r\n```\r\n[shlvl]\r\ndisabled=true\r\nthreshold=3\r\nprefix=\"shlvl@\"\r\nsuffix=\"\"\r\nstyle=\"bold yellow dimmed\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nI would stick it in the defaults after `hostname`.\r\n\r\nexample output:\r\n```\r\nshlvl@3\r\n```\r\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
