    "body": "There's a separate question of how this module should behave for shells that don't support this. bash and zsh have that, no idea about other ones, or even other platforms. In theory, it'd be possible to work it out for yourself - travel up the `ppid` chain, but I feell like it'd be flaky as hell. :)",
